      "title": "epan: Use unsigned offsets with tvb_ensure_bytes_exist",
      "message": "epan: Use unsigned offsets with tvb_ensure_bytes_exist\n\nThere are no cases in the repository of this function being used\nwith a negative offset. A negative offset doesn't make sense to\nuse, especially as a negative offset is from the end of the captured\ndata (not reported data, as one might think).  There's always a\nmore sensible way to express that.\n\nThe one function that calls it internally, tvb_get_raw_string,\nalready throws a DissectorError if its offset parameter is < 0.\n\nPing #20103\n",
